Modified files (Apache-2.0 §4(b))
================================================================================

The patch in patches/qsa-nvfp4-kv.diff modifies these five files of SGLang at
commit fb1216c6c, relative to python/sglang/srt/ :

  layers/attention/qsa/sparse_attn.py
  layers/attention/qwen_sparse_attn_backend.py
  mem_cache/kv_cache_configurator.py
  mem_cache/memory_pool.py
  server_args.py

and adds one new file:

  layers/attention/qsa_nvfp4_kv.py

SHA256 of all five files in their unmodified, pre-patch state is recorded in
patches/EXPECTED-SHA256. No verbatim copy of any SGLang source file is
redistributed here; the diff carries only the context lines needed to apply it.

